lly increasing my material advantage and putting Black under overwhelming pressure, likely leading to a quick win.\n\nReason: Queen promotion is the most forcing and highest-value move available. There is no tactical downside (no capture on a8, and no risk of stalemate), so choosing any other promotion or move would be suboptimal.\n\nAnswer: P: a7-a8-q'}
